{"product":{"id":6860137169033,"title":"Eagle Rare 10 Year Kentucky Straight Bourbon Whiskey","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eEagle Rare Bourbon is a classic \u003cstrong\u003eKentucky straight bourbon whiskey\u003c\/strong\u003e known for its smooth character, refined balance, and rich, mature flavor profile. Crafted with the tradition and precision that have made it a favorite among bourbon drinkers, this premium bourbon opens with inviting notes of \u003cstrong\u003eoak\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003evanilla\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong\u003ecaramel\u003c\/strong\u003e, followed by a rounded palate with gentle spice and lasting warmth. Elegant enough for sipping neat and versatile enough for elevated cocktails, Eagle Rare is a strong choice for shoppers seeking \u003cstrong\u003epremium bourbon\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003eKentucky bourbon\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003esmooth sipping whiskey\u003c\/strong\u003e, or a dependable bottle with strong gift and collector appeal.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePremium \u003cstrong\u003eKentucky straight bourbon whiskey\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSmooth, balanced bourbon profile with \u003cstrong\u003eoak\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003evanilla\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong\u003ecaramel\u003c\/strong\u003e notes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGreat for sipping neat, over ice, or in bourbon-forward cocktails\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrong fit for fans of \u003cstrong\u003eclassic bourbon\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003epremium American whiskey\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong\u003egiftable bourbon\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eElegant bottle presentation with iconic eagle artwork\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIdeal for \u003cstrong\u003eOld Fashioneds\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003eManhattans\u003c\/strong\u003e, and easy sipping pours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePopular among bourbon enthusiasts and whiskey collectors\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eProduct Details\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBrand: \u003cstrong\u003eEagle Rare\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eProduct Name: \u003cstrong\u003eBourbon\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCategory: \u003cstrong\u003eBourbon Whiskey\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStyle: \u003cstrong\u003eKentucky Straight Bourbon Whiskey\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCountry: \u003cstrong\u003eUnited States\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRegion: \u003cstrong\u003eKentucky\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBottle Format: Standard bottle\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClosure: Screw cap\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eTasting Notes\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNose:\u003c\/strong\u003e Sweet \u003cstrong\u003eoak\u003c\/strong\u003e, vanilla, caramel, and soft bourbon spice\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePalate:\u003c\/strong\u003e Smooth and rounded with notes of toffee, toasted oak, vanilla, and gentle baking spice\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFinish:\u003c\/strong\u003e Long, clean, and warming with lingering caramel sweetness and oak depth\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePairings\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEagle Rare Bourbon pairs beautifully with \u003cstrong\u003esmoked brisket\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003egrilled steak\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003eaged cheddar\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003ecandied pecans\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003epecan pie\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong\u003edark chocolate\u003c\/strong\u003e. It is especially well suited for sipping neat, over a large cube, or mixing into a premium \u003cstrong\u003eOld Fashioned\u003c\/strong\u003e or \u003cstrong\u003eManhattan\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eEagle Rare 10 Year: Tasting Summary\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEagle Rare 10 Year is a Kentucky straight bourbon whiskey crafted at Buffalo Trace Distillery in Frankfort, Kentucky, and one of Buffalo Trace's most respected labels. It is made from the distillery's low-rye mash bill #1 and aged for a full decade in charred American oak barrels; that decade of patience gives this 10 year old bourbon remarkable depth and complexity. Expect complex aromas of toffee with hints of orange peel, then layers of toffee, honey, leather, and oak, plus dried fruit and corn sweetness and oak on the palate. The finish is long, dry and lingering: dry yet delicate, bold yet refined. Bottled at 90 proof, a proof that balances boldness with approachability, the Eagle Rare 10 750ml bottle continues a legacy of excellence from Buffalo Trace Distillery.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFAQs\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat kind of whiskey is Eagle Rare Bourbon?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIt is a \u003cstrong\u003eKentucky straight bourbon whiskey\u003c\/strong\u003e known for its smooth texture and balanced flavor profile.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat does Eagle Rare Bourbon taste like?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIt offers notes of \u003cstrong\u003eoak\u003c\/strong\u003e, vanilla, caramel, toffee, and soft baking spice with a long, warming finish.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIs Eagle Rare Bourbon good for sipping?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eYes. Its smooth and polished character makes it an excellent \u003cstrong\u003esipping bourbon\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCan Eagle Rare Bourbon be used in cocktails?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eYes. It works very well in classic bourbon cocktails like an \u003cstrong\u003eOld Fashioned\u003c\/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eManhattan\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Eagle Rare","product_type":"Bourbon","created_at":"2022-04-08T17:20:53-07:00","handle":"eagle-rare","updated_at":"2026-10-23T09:55:54-07:00","published_at":"2022-04-08T17:20:52-07:00","template_suffix":"eagle-rare","published_scope":"global","tags":"bourbon, Brands: Buffalo Trace, Brands: Eagle Rare, decpapi, Distributor: Republic National, eagle-rare, ENGRAVEABLE, limit-one, over-10, Rare, Rare Whiskey, under-100, under-50","variants":[{"id":45411077685385,"product_id":6860137169033,"title":"750mL","price":"44.99","sku":"19235","position":1,"compare_at_price":"109.99","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":null,"option1":"750mL","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2026-03-20T15:01:52-07:00","updated_at":"2026-10-23T09:55:54-07:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"088004021344","grams":1814,"image_id":32088656543881,"weight":4.0,"weight_unit":"lb","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"USD","quantity_price_breaks":[]}],"options":[{"id":10978384183433,"product_id":6860137169033,"name":"Size","position":1,"values":["750mL"]}],"images":[{"id":32088656543881,"product_id":6860137169033,"position":1,"created_at":"2024-02-10T16:51:37-08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-10T14:06:39-07:00","alt":"Eagle Rare 10 Year Kentucky Straight Bourbon Whiskey - Main Street Liquor","width":1000,"height":1000,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0577\/3013\/8249\/products\/eagle-rare-10-year-kentucky-straight-bourbon-whiskey-1041969.jpg?v=1781125599","variant_ids":[45411077685385]}],"image":{"id":32088656543881,"product_id":6860137169033,"position":1,"created_at":"2024-02-10T16:51:37-08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-10T14:06:39-07:00","alt":"Eagle Rare 10 Year Kentucky Straight Bourbon Whiskey - Main Street Liquor","width":1000,"height":1000,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0577\/3013\/8249\/products\/eagle-rare-10-year-kentucky-straight-bourbon-whiskey-1041969.jpg?v=1781125599","variant_ids":[45411077685385]}}}